            <ArticleTitle>An unusual case of acute urinary retention in young females.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>775-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Urinary retention is an unusual problem in females and may be psychogenic, especially in the young. However it is important to remember that there are also organic causes for retention. We present 2 cases of an uncommon cause of urinary retention in the young female, namely hematocolpos.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
